  "id": "list_2d_building_polys",
  "title": "LIST 2D Building Polys",
  "description": "LIST 2D Building Polys: LIST product `LIST_2D_BUILDING_POLYS`, statewide. 462,218 features, multi-polygon (EPSG:28355). Built from the 29 per-LGA LIST zips: features LIST clipped at LGA boundaries are rejoined to one row per `LIST_GUID`, and an `lga` column names the source LGA(s); parts outside every LGA (over open water) are not in any LGA file. Source released 2025-07-17. Data (c) State of Tasmania, CC BY 3.0 AU: cite as \"LIST 2D Building Polys\" from theLIST (c) State of Tasmania.",
